    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>Hidden Greens is a Maine medical cannabis dispensary operating the Buxton storefront at 370 Narragansett Trail. The company operates as a multi-location medical operator across Maine, with the Buxton location serving as the flagship along the southern Maine corridor between Gorham, Saco, and Standish.</p>
    <p>Hidden Greens markets itself as a quality-focused operator that treats clean, tested product as a baseline rather than a marketing angle — a positioning aimed at medical patients who depend on consistent, accurately labeled medicine. The Buxton storefront carries flower, pre-rolls, edibles, vapes, topicals, and concentrates sourced from in-house cultivation.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Location, Hours, and Access</h2>
    <p><strong>Address:</strong> 370 Narragansett Trail, Buxton, ME 04093<br>
    <strong>Phone:</strong> (207) 298-9111</p>
    <p>Buxton is a small York County town of roughly 8,300 residents, situated between Gorham, Standish, Hollis, and Saco. The Narragansett Trail (Route 202 / Route 112) corridor is one of southern Maine's main east-west connectors, giving Hidden Greens direct access from Portland (~25 min), Saco/Biddeford (~15-20 min), and the Sebago Lakes region (~20 min north).</p>
    <p>Hours per the operator's public listings: open seven days a week, with most days running 9am to 8pm or 9pm. Some weeknights close earlier. Call (207) 298-9111 to confirm current hours before visiting.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Medical vs. Adult-Use</h2>
    <p>Hidden Greens operates as a <strong>medical cannabis dispensary</strong>. Customers must hold a valid Maine medical marijuana program (MMMP) card to make on-site purchases. Out-of-state medical patients with cards from reciprocity states (Massachusetts, Rhode Island, and others) should call ahead to confirm the dispensary's current reciprocity acceptance.</p>
    <p>Adult-use (21+) customers may not be able to transact on-site. Some Maine medical dispensaries have added adult-use endorsements under the dual-license framework, but the licensing mix varies by operator. Confirm directly with Hidden Greens before visiting if you are an adult-use customer without an MMMP card.</p>
  </section>

